type: dataset
title: "The Archimedean Prism"
abstract: "Tame Period Geometry and the Hodge Conjecture. A monograph in five volumes bound as one, a self-contained research subject of the Grothendieckian Programme: algebraicity of Hodge classes as a descent datum along a definable bi-Rees prism, twelve axioms, an unconditional equivalence of five formulations of the Hodge Conjecture, an obstruction ledger with two live entries, and a specified computational and formal-verification architecture. The Hodge conjecture remains open."
